{
  "name": "Conference on \"Higher education in developing countries: with a focus on Muslim contexts\"",
  "parent_id": 203314133681389,
  "group_id": "615eb3c6-c9fb-48fe-a9a3-06d4bbadcb91",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:19:25.876Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:02:37.711Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:02:37.694Z",
  "id": 203980660259878,
  "uuid": "626757e3-be70-46c9-95c6-42255e218332",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "334b5fc1-ccf0-bd85-acd1-c952b4a053ee",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "31b01ae8-b871-50b2-6378-5a2d9f76c7a5",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "While there are numerous initiatives focused on higher education in developing countries, there continues to be a need for a sustainable platform for deliberation on issues affecting higher education, particularly in Muslim contexts.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "AKU-ISMC seeks to make this conference the starting point of an ongoing dialogue. The conference deliberations will be disseminated through the Institute's website and a post-conference publication. The conference aims to bring together students, educators, scholars and decision-makers from around the world to create an intellectual platform for an assessment of present educational programmes and the future of higher education in developing countries, and more specifically within Muslim contexts.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The conference focuses on two main themes:",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "ordered_list",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Vision, purpose and aims of higher education in developing countries; and ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "list_item",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "text": "Reforms and innovations in higher education - successes and lessons learned. ",
                          "type": "text"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Morning plenary sessions will be followed by afternoon workshops. The online registration deadline is January 31, 2005 and abstracts are welcome by November 30, 2004.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "To submit abstracts, register for the conference or for any other information, please visit www.aku.edu/news/seminars/hedc.  ",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "AKU-ISMC hopes to make a distinct contribution to the understanding of Muslim societies and the emergence of new attitudes among Muslims and non-Muslims toward issues facing the Muslim world.",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
